  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c59921a22062079419e0bffed4cfa04b, type: 3}
  m_Name: D-01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DispatchScenarioData
  scenarioId: D-01
  readyForPlay: 1
  callerName: Zeynep
  callerLocation: İzmir, Bayraklı
  emergencyType: Deprem
  situationSummary: 7. katta, iki yaşındaki kızıyla sarsıntı sırasında içeride.
  sourceNotes: "Kaynak: kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n 17.10.2026 tarihli k\u0131sa senaryo metni. Yaln\u0131zca konu\u015fmalar ve se\u00e7enekler g\u00fcncellendi; oyun kurallar\u0131 korundu."
  opening:
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: Alo! Kurban olay\u0131m yard\u0131m edin, y\u0131k\u0131l\u0131yoruz!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: 912 Acil, ben Operat\u00f6r Melek. Sakin olun, isminiz ve durumunuz nedir?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: Zeynep ben! \u0130zmir Bayrakl\u0131'day\u0131z, 7. kattay\u0131z! Bina be\u015fik gibi sallan\u0131yor, vitrin tuzla buz oldu!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: Zeynep Han\u0131m, arama kurtarma ekibini y\u00f6nlendiriyorum. Yan\u0131n\u0131zda kim var?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Zeynep: 2 ya\u015f\u0131ndaki k\u0131z\u0131m kuca\u011f\u0131mda! Kom\u015fu kap\u0131dan f\u0131rlad\u0131, 'Merdivenlerden a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 ko\u015fun, bina y\u0131k\u0131lacak!' diye ba\u011f\u0131r\u0131yor!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Zeynep: Operat\u00f6r Han\u0131m, k\u0131z\u0131mla merdivenlere f\u0131rlayay\u0131m m\u0131 hemen?!"
    fromOperator: 0
  choiceA: "Evet, bina y\u0131k\u0131lmadan hemen merdivenlerden a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 ko\u015fun!"
  choiceB: "HAYIR! Sak\u0131n merdivenlere ko\u015fmay\u0131n! \u0130\u00e7eri d\u00f6n\u00fcp \u00c7\u00d6K-KAPAN-TUTUN yap\u0131n!"
  correctChoiceIsB: 1
  resourceA: 2
  resourceB: 1
  dispatchA: 1
  dispatchB: 1
  outcomeA:
  - text: "Zeynep: Ko\u015fuyorum! Merdivendeyiz... Aaaah! Basamaklar ayr\u0131l\u0131yor, tutunam\u0131yorum!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Telsiz: Merkez! Merdiven \u00e7\u00f6kt\u00fc, anne ve bebek enkaz alt\u0131nda! Acil arama kurtarma ve takviye ambulans istiyoruz!"
    fromOperator: 0
  outcomeB:
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: Zeynep Han\u0131m geri d\u00f6n\u00fcn! A\u011f\u0131r bir bazan\u0131n yan\u0131na \u00e7\u00f6k\u00fcn, \u00e7ocu\u011fu g\u00f6\u011fs\u00fcn\u00fcze sar\u0131p ba\u015f\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 koruyun!"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Zeynep: Tamam, bazan\u0131n yan\u0131na \u00e7\u00f6kt\u00fck... Sallant\u0131 durdu! Merdiven bo\u015flu\u011fu \u00e7\u00f6kt\u00fc, iyi ki \u00e7\u0131kmam\u0131\u015f\u0131z! \u0130yiyiz biz, ekiplerinizi bekliyoruz!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\u00f6r: Kurtarma ekibimiz sizi g\u00fcvenle indirmek i\u00e7in kap\u0131n\u0131za ula\u015ft\u0131."
    fromOperator: 1
